ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-05T17:42:42Z","updated_at":"2021-02-05T17:42:42Z","body":"Looks like the closest match is to PostgreSQL License, with differences in order of wording and omission of \"lost profits\" in the disclaimer text.\r\nGiven that this is only used by one project and I'm not sure how active that project is, I'd be inclined not to add it. \r\n\r\n@pmadick @swinslow @johnmhoran - comments?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/774182098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/778865026","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1161#issuecomment-778865026","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1161","id":778865026,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3ODg2NTAyNg==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-02-15T00:02:03Z","updated_at":"2021-02-15T00:02:28Z","body":"I'm finding a number of other projects that use this same text:\r\n* https://ptolemy.berkeley.edu/copyright.htm\r\n* http://groups.csail.mit.edu/graphics/lapis/doc/legal/Jacl-license.html (in the first half of this file, it's hard to read)\r\n* https://pirlwww.lpl.arizona.edu/resources/guide/software/PerlTk/Tixlic.html\r\n\r\nThe first two (and the original submission) are University of California, but the third one isn't (and uses \"authors of this software\" in place of \"University of California\" in several places).\r\n\r\nThe Fedora wiki lists this text on their MIT page under \"Modern Variants\": https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Licensing:MIT#Modern_Variants\r\n\r\nI would vote in favor of adding it. I think the harder question is what to call it. I wouldn't go with `ABC` here, since it looks like that's just one project using it. Perhaps `MIT-Modern-Variant` since that's how the Fedora wiki folks originally catalogued it?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/778865026/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/780317362","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1161#issuecomment-780317362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1161","id":780317362,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc4MDMxNzM2Mg==","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url